  "description": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY** \n\n**UNFURNISHED**\n\nRedmond Property Consultants are delighted to present to the rental market this spacious three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home, ideally situated at 18 Castleview Park, in the highly sought-after Castleview development in Swords.\n\nOverlooking a well-maintained green area, this attractive home enjoys a pleasant setting within the development and offers spacious, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property is presented to the market unfurnished.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, guest WC, spacious living room with double doors leading through to the kitchen/dining area. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite, along with a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a good-sized rear garden with a convenient side entrance, as well as off-street parking to the front.\n\nThe property is fitted with gas-fired central heating and is ideally located close to a wide range of amenities. Local schools, Applewood Village, Swords Express and Dublin Bus services, a gym and creche are all within easy walking distance.\n",
